      "content": "it's just that i say that but i don't feel like a real person anymore. when everything you do is rejected and you're just waiting for the next disaster, you start to feel like you're already gone. like i'm already dead, just waiting for my body to catch up. it feels like the only thing i actually have control over is deciding when to stop fighting this. if i can't exist in their world, why should i be forced to keep staying in it?",
